WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.263 --> 00:00:02.680
CRAIG LABENZ: In
the last episode,

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:06.150
you created a web app in Cloud
Run backed by a Cloud SQL

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:06.847
