00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:36.420
MARTIN OMANDER: Oh,
I've heard of that.

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:37.260
Let's see.

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:38.470
Python3 and pip.

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:38.970
OK.

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:41.467
I'm installing it now.

00:00:41.467 --> 00:00:42.300
CRAIG LABENZ: Great.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:47.467
I also sent you another file
earlier called locustfile.py.

00:00:47.467 --> 00:00:48.300
MARTIN OMANDER: Yep.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:50.130
I have it right here.

00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:53.843
What does this file do exactly?

00:00:53.843 --> 00:00:55.260
CRAIG LABENZ: It
creates two types

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:58.320
